s="wrapper"><div class="container"><div class="header"><img src="https://alphaclonesystems.com/logo.png" alt="AlphaClone" class="logo"><h1>MORNING BRIEFING</h1></div><div class="content"><p>Good morning, {{name}}.</p><p>Your business operating system has processed the overnight data. Here is your strategic outlook for today.</p><div class="card"><h3 style="color:#fff;margin-top:0">Market Sentiment: <span class="accent-text">BULLISH</span></h3><p style="margin-bottom:0">We have identified 12 new high-intent leads in your target sector. AI prioritization is complete.</p></div><p>Your team huddle is scheduled for 09:00 UTC. The war room is prepared.</p><div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px"><a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="btn">View Dashboard</a></div><div class="divider"></div><p style="font-size:14px;text-align:center">Questions? Securely contact our ops team at<br><a href="mailto:ops@alphaclonesystems.com" style="color:#14b8a6;text-decoration:none">ops@alphaclonesystems.com</a></p></div><div class="footer"><p>&copy; 2026 AlphaClone Systems. Proprietary & Confidential.</p></div></div></div></body></html>',
